  "sources": {
   "kardex_tray_power": "#53: 'the trays will not retain power while in motion. They will only have power when stored, or again when they arrive at the delivery bay'; the dealer offered 'a quick connect cord' to the device on the tray. Kardex's own Shuttle option list shows no powered-tray or media option (kardex.com/products/vertical-lift/kardex-shuttle).",
   "combitac_align4": "Staubli CombiTac uniq catalogue (CT-Main-11014009-en) p.80-81: CombiTac align 4, misalignment compensation radial 4 mm, angular +-2 deg; 100,000 mating cycles; the plug side's pins guide, the socket side is conical. p.82: 'the customer must provide a stable guide system, e.g. with mechanical pins'. p.87: largest gap between mated carriers 1-2 mm.",
   "combitac_power": "CombiTac catalogue p.26: 'O 3 mm power unit up to 39 A', 600 V (pollution degree 2/CAT II).",
   "combitac_data": "CombiTac catalogue p.46-49: 10 Gbit module, 'Ethernet up to 10 Gbit/s (Cat6a or higher)', RJ45 or M12 X-coded, 100,000 cycles, 14 N sliding force, 22 mm wide.",
   "combitac_air": "CombiTac catalogue p.61-69: RCT06 pneumatic, 6 mm bore, shut-off on one side, 15 bar; 'Connecting and disconnecting under pressure is prohibited.'",
   "combitac_fluid": "CombiTac catalogue p.70-75: SCT03 (G1/8) and LCT06 (G1/4), 'leakproof, shut-off on both sides', 15 bar; LCT06 8.48 L/min at 5 m/s, counter force 135 N at 10 bar; pressure drop 0.2-0.3 bar. Fluid couplings 'can also be used for pneumatic applications'.",
   "odu_dock": "ODU-MAC Silver-Line P4+ docking frame: 'axial 1mm, radial +/- 4mm', floating, 100,000 cycles (ODU via adsgroup.org.uk).",
   "harting_dock": "Harting Han 6 Mod Docking Frame 09140061716: floating +-2 mm, lock-in +-4 mm, >=10,000 cycles (harting.com).",
